      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10894205::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 5–10 at% Ti or Zr to NbMoTaW is an appropriate intervention for balancing ductility, irradiation tolerance, and high-temperature performance.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An NbMoTaW alloy containing 5–10 at% Ti or Zr can retain a BCC-dominated structure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10894205::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HCP-forming additive will increase local lattice distortion in the BCC alloy.",
