      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10894205::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower dislocation core energies will activate additional or alternative slip systems.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10894205::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Altered dislocation behavior will increase the room-temperature plastic strain to fracture relative to untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10894205::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Local compositional inhomogeneity caused by Ti or Zr may promote irradiation-defect recombination.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Local compositional inhomogeneity caused by Ti or Zr may trap irradiation-induced defects.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will accumulate fewer irradiation-induced defects than untreated NbMoTaW under helium implantation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will exhibit less helium-induced blistering than untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modification will mitigate irradiation-induced amorphization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The BCC majority phase will preserve high-temperature mechanical performance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature strength through approximately 1600 °C will decrease by less than 5% relative to untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
